  "sourceLimitations": [
    "Đình Trung Yên: the Hà Nội Department of Culture source returned HTTP 502 and the Tourism Administration page rendered no article text during this check. The stories and captions identify the stop but omit the unverified monument date, worshipped figure, and ranking.",
    "Chùa Cầu Đông: reporting supports the 38B Hàng Đường address and statue description, but not its exact distance or position relative to Ngõ Gạch's western end; the caption and story say so.",
    "Phở gà Hương Trà and the three Ngõ Gạch cafés have no dedicated source in the research inventory. Their stories retain route location only and do not claim menus, hours, or history.",
    "Phất Lộc: a report describes three branches, but the junction at Tiên Hạ Temple and the passage near house 34 need on-site verification; the story does not present them as measured directions.",
    "Đền Vọng Tiên's story at Cấm Chỉ focuses on competing alley-name explanations and states their uncertainty; its Tạm Thương story carries the separate temple legend."
